{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"57818","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57818","key":"SV-11325","fields":{"summary":"Tech View: number link, progress bar and advisor avatar as in the design","description":"h3. What\n\nRestyle three Tech View cells to the design.\n\nh3. Expected\n\nS2-R20: \"Tech View's cells follow the design: the work order number shows as a link in the accent color; Progress shows as a thin bar with the percentage beside it; Service Advisor shows the advisor's avatar before the name. Clocked In keeps List's display (S5-R11).\"\n\nPRD: [Board View & Tech View PRD v51|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (S2-R20).\n\nh3. Actual (staging build, develop b19269d4487, clicked through locally)\n\nNumber is plain text, Progress is a colored percentage pill, and Service Advisor shows the name only, as in List.\n\nh3. How to check\n\n* Number shows as an accent-color link and opens the work order.\n* Progress shows a thin bar plus the percentage.\n* Service Advisor shows avatar then name.\n* Clocked In looks exactly as in List.\n* List's cells are unchanged.\n\nh3. Screenshots\n\nAttached: staging build first, Branko's design (files starting D) after.\n\nRaised from Sasha's staging review, 2026-10-14.\n\n----\n\n*Test case for this design issue:*\n\n* [C590114|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590114] Tech View cells show a blue number, a thin progress bar and the advisor's avatar","comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57818/comment/78738","id":"78738","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.